{"channelId":"UCPa2DmenfIZBZBqdzCl5KPw","row":["Kate Physiotherapist With Braid",14600,"My name is Kate and I am a physiotherapist. I graduated from the medical university and I work as a physiotherapist with children and adults. \n\nYouTube is just a hobby. I thought that it can be nice to share my knowledge with you. So on this channel you will find videos related to health, rehabilitation and physiotherapy. I am a practitioner, so I will share with you my insights and professional experiences. But besides, I’m a huge fan of Evidence Based Medicine, so in every post and movie I make you’ll find references to scientific research.\n\nThere are no product ads on this channel (and never will). At most, I will occasionally criticize products that I (and scientists) believe are useless.\n\nHope you enjoy the content,\n\nKate","","Poland"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPa2DmenfIZBZBqdzCl5KPw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPa2DmenfIZBZBqdzCl5KPw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:58.682Z","channelId":"UCPa2DmenfIZBZBqdzCl5KPw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0f9d8f26de3077a8e5df7d09b7a5d80ae7cdc25d31296d96ad8ba5923cf7ed07","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f32f6440fbf5ded7c300f616be9e3f44fcf159ae57bee4b4a9d55d1072b12da6"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPa2DmenfIZBZBqdzCl5KPw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:25:42.931Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPa2DmenfIZBZBqdzCl5KPw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":14600,"raw":"14.6K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPa2DmenfIZBZBqdzCl5KPw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:58.682Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["physical therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["physical therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"practitioner_s